### GET request to token bucket test endpoint without rate limiter (bypasses the gateway route entirely)
GET http://localhost:8083/test/tokenbucket

### GET request to leaky bucket test endpoint without rate limiter (bypasses the gateway route entirely)
GET http://localhost:8083/test/leakybucket

### GET health check
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/health

### GET registered routes from the gateway
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/gateway/routes


### =========================================================
### Token Bucket (route1): /tokenbucket/** -> StripPrefix -> sample-api /user
### capacity=5, refill 5 tokens / 60s -> 6th call within the window should 429
### =========================================================

### Token bucket call #1 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/tokenbucket/user

### Token bucket call #2 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/tokenbucket/user

### Token bucket call #3 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/tokenbucket/user

### Token bucket call #4 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/tokenbucket/user

### Token bucket call #5 (allowed, bucket now empty)
GET http://localhost:8083/tokenbucket/user

### Token bucket call #6 (expect 429 Too Many Requests)
GET http://localhost:8083/tokenbucket/user


### =========================================================
### Leaky Bucket (route2): /leakybucket/** -> StripPrefix -> sample-api /login
### capacity=10, leak 1/sec -> 11th call in quick succession should 429
### =========================================================

### Leaky bucket call #1 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/leakybucket/login

### Leaky bucket call #2 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/leakybucket/login

### Leaky bucket call #3 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/leakybucket/login

### Leaky bucket call #4 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/leakybucket/login

### Leaky bucket call #5 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/leakybucket/login

### Leaky bucket call #6 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/leakybucket/login

### Leaky bucket call #7 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/leakybucket/login

### Leaky bucket call #8 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/leakybucket/login

### Leaky bucket call #9 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/leakybucket/login

### Leaky bucket call #10 (allowed, bucket now full)
GET http://localhost:8083/leakybucket/login

### Leaky bucket call #11 (expect 429 Too Many Requests, run quickly after #10 before it leaks)
GET http://localhost:8083/leakybucket/login


### =========================================================
### Sliding Window Counter, in-memory (ForwardingController): /slidingwindow/** -> sample-api
### limit=3 requests / 30s window, scoped per key+IP
### =========================================================

### Sliding window (local) call #1 for 1.2.3.4 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/slidingwindow/user
X-Forwarded-For: 1.2.3.4

### Sliding window (local) call #2 for 1.2.3.4 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/slidingwindow/user
X-Forwarded-For: 1.2.3.4

### Sliding window (local) call #3 for 1.2.3.4 (allowed, quota now exhausted)
GET http://localhost:8083/slidingwindow/user
X-Forwarded-For: 1.2.3.4

### Sliding window (local) call #4 for 1.2.3.4 (expect 429 Too Many Requests)
GET http://localhost:8083/slidingwindow/user
X-Forwarded-For: 1.2.3.4

### Sliding window (local) call for a different IP on the same route (allowed - independent quota per IP)
GET http://localhost:8083/slidingwindow/user
X-Forwarded-For: 5.6.7.8

### Sliding window (local) against a different path (independent quota per key)
GET http://localhost:8083/slidingwindow/login
X-Forwarded-For: 1.2.3.4


### =========================================================
### Sliding Window Counter, Redis-backed (ForwardingController): /slidingwindow-redis/** -> sample-api
### limit=3 requests / 30s window, scoped per key+IP, state lives in Redis (survives app restarts)
### =========================================================

### Sliding window (redis) call #1 for 9.9.9.9 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/slidingwindow-redis/user
X-Forwarded-For: 9.9.9.9

### Sliding window (redis) call #2 for 9.9.9.9 (allowed)
GET http://localhost:8083/slidingwindow-redis/user
X-Forwarded-For: 9.9.9.9

### Sliding window (redis) call #3 for 9.9.9.9 (allowed, quota now exhausted)
GET http://localhost:8083/slidingwindow-redis/user
X-Forwarded-For: 9.9.9.9

### Sliding window (redis) call #4 for 9.9.9.9 (expect 429 Too Many Requests)
GET http://localhost:8083/slidingwindow-redis/user
X-Forwarded-For: 9.9.9.9
